 are incompatible with Golconda anyway (e.g., Daimonion 10).</div> </div> </div> </div>Golconda is a rather fairytale than option. All those attach it are legends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T10:29:13-07:00","id":1450847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1450606-use-of-level-10-disciplines?p=1450831#post1450831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Golconda is a rather fairytale than option. All those attach it are legends.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is, but it's also stated in the rulebook how you can attain it, so it is possible that way. But you have to be squeaky clean. I believe in the past, other Paths had similar methods to enlightenment, but that wasn't consistent through all editions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T11:36:36-07:00","id":1450859,"title":"","content":"It's largely up to the GM how much of a fairy tale Golconda is too. Many early-edition books had characters in Golconda. Even Revised-era Cairo by Night had a vampire in Golconda. He was 11th+ generation and had Auspex 7. <br /> <br /> Are there more Golcondites than Antediluvians? At the end of the night, both are vanishingly rare.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T18:51:06-07:00","id":1450900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>False Epiphany</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1450606-use-of-level-10-disciplines?p=1450859#post1450859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Many early-edition books had characters in Golconda. Even Revised-era Cairo by Night had a vampire in Golconda. He was 11th+